{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>樂壇天后林憶蓮一連兩場在啟德主場館舉行的《迴響巡迴演唱會 RESONANCE : Reconstructed Hong Kong Exclusive》今日（16日）正式開鑼，契爺胡楓、連炎輝也專誠捧場，全場爆滿。憶蓮穿上艷紅衫配黑褲，躺在緩緩升起的升降機舞台上登場，並以一曲《沉淪》揭開序幕。之後連唱《天大地大》、《傾斜》等輕快歌曲跳唱，更狂颷高音展現天后實力，今次以廣東歌作主軸，勾起樂迷青春回憶！</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132420475512164352672149.jpeg/hl_Ie-RogHb8OCqV1bWojZ0lQezyDDlBo9M4ppbTOKY\" alt=\"林憶蓮相隔9年再於香港開騷。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>林憶蓮相隔9年再於香港開騷。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132420473276469248213965.jpeg/Dz-G6iSVoCRMFZPgADLEQHdfMk-M9wkJaWrSEV9q0hE\" alt=\"林憶蓮躺在升降機台上登場。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>林憶蓮躺在升降機台上登場。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132420468477923328204871.jpeg/rlDQsuDNCKuyxz22U2bsuFPuL0HF0itzhWVfOLxlXzg\" alt=\"狂颷高音！（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>狂颷高音！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132420466158342144067329.jpeg/qMEC7XFALlGnLTYT5OycEF8hZCEpR5_7RDY8S302PEs\" alt=\"展現天后實力！（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>展現天后實力！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132420470877196288679381.jpeg/6ROwTYzu0Nv1nxhUf5rLtUwsaoU7SRGTwf6yeej-snk\" alt=\"連炎輝同胡楓（修哥）都有捧場。\"><figcaption>連炎輝同胡楓（修哥）都有捧場。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132422638992494592384016.jpeg/IxxP7jVGS-cyYeGl4CKOAtT1l2BN35NzudIQkYzSEJE\" alt=\"跳唱！（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>跳唱！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132422636496752640934758.jpeg/vWR4K_KlOB_OeRGPgX6jj0FeqCY854EUuYbmtoyG5rY\" alt=\"跳唱！（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>跳唱！（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>演唱會中段，林憶蓮獻唱《微涼》時被樂迷的熱情感染，感觸落淚，全場fans起哄。之後憶蓮忍著淚水，向樂迷說：「多謝，多謝大家！我哋終於返到嚟香港，我哋終於將《迴響》帶到我哋香港，最特別、我最在乎嘅（香港）….」全場尖叫歡呼，而憶蓮則感觸得別轉面。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132431494795890688791542.jpeg/eGhn9Aa7pSm_1cZW4Coa9s_aOyWOK-R7JF5bCxFeWws\" alt=\"林憶蓮感觸落淚。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>林憶蓮感觸落淚。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132431491926855680572180.jpeg/lx4hzqELn6_y5rrNyuvHdEbxmdFoxcgFhub7U7Pm-1M\" alt=\"林憶蓮感觸落淚。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>林憶蓮感觸落淚。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132431489338839040760324.jpeg/S4rNBDHzOO6woRpI3gk_mswsj5CSP4SzN9F7cwLRe3M\" alt=\"林憶蓮感觸落淚。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>林憶蓮感觸落淚。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260516/1132431486469804032628139.jpeg/lglkBcS4P4x6rxOsq0TSZsUDKLddynI3fumHoVvph6E\" alt=\"林憶蓮感觸落淚。（影片截圖）\"><figcaption>林憶蓮感觸落淚。（影片截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-16T14:26:57.936109+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":486,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}